{"reviewId": "426066534_8aMZEiTTF", "review": {"abstract": "当效率降低时，资本主义体系仍然期望按照原有的增长速度运行，这就必然会增加资本投资", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "这是我比较难以理解的，为啥企业都追求每年增长，比如今年挣1000万，明年就得增长10%挣1100万，不然就不及预期，但是每年都能挣1000万不也蛮好的嘛", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "4499-4539", "createTime": 1784719881, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "426066534_8aMZEiTTF", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 0, "likes": [], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "我觉得这是企业代表的资本的必然要求。如果一个企业无法实现资本增长的需求，资本就会离开这家企业，投入到能够实现这种增长的地方去。", "reviewId": "426066534_8aMZEiTTF", "commentId": "426066534_8aMZEiTTF_c410535438_8aSv4ykXB", "userVid": 410535438, "createTime": 1785032671, "likesCount": 1, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 410535438, "name": "我是小水花", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Cz2BSzllb9CuwCDtGqQpqeHuBAibibwXZnhIwY4OGicM34VUC2kFUmf96U3w71Y6oLgWTNzfnCfAlMKn0HM4nibRTwymFs9x9ibDoictUOqzDG158/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking":